            <div xml:id="d693">

                <pb facs="0748" n="660" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg660"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.3531/198</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Assistant Secretary of State</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-10-02">October 2, 1933</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I had a visit this afternoon from Señor Espil, the Argentine Ambassador, who came
                    to talk to me about the treaty conversations. He and I agreed that the best
                    first step on his part would be to give us a memorandum setting out the general
                    ideas of the Argentine Government in pertinent connection. He said that he would
                    hand it to me on Thursday next.</p>
                <closer><signed>J[<hi rendition="#small-caps">efferson</hi>] C[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">affery</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
